## Technical Summary
- **Database**: `paragraphs_dashboard` (id, en, ru, uz, specialist, text_id, action_type, timestamp).
- **Frontend**: Navigation added to sidebar; unified `[category]/page.tsx` now handles the 4th linguistic category dynamically.
- **Tracking**:
  - **Manual Edit**: Recorded on individual row save in TableEditor.
  - **AI Polished**: Recorded after individual or batch "Sayqallash" actions.
  - **Verified**: Recorded when clicking "Ишни якунлаш" (Finish Work).

> [!TIP]
> The system now maintains a "Golden Source" of translations in the Paragraphs Dashboard, which can be reused for future AI training or cross-document consistency checks.
